From c18c6336ead059c620262b4835d454f64203f850 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: venper <venper@qti.qualcomm.com>
Date: Wed, 29 Oct 2025 12:38:40 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] net cdc_ether Ensure that default MTU is minimum 204

eap-qti-kernel 6.12 Driver Patch Updates:
File changes and configuration support have been added to align with kernel 6.12.
In the CDC Ethernet module, a patch has been added to set the default MTU packet size.

Signed-off-by: venper <venper@qti.qualcomm.com>
---
 drivers/net/usb/cdc_ether.c | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/net/usb/cdc_ether.c b/drivers/net/usb/cdc_ether.c
index a6469235d904..f8f60eccd4d8 100644
--- a/drivers/net/usb/cdc_ether.c
+++ b/drivers/net/usb/cdc_ether.c
@@ -325,6 +325,9 @@ int usbnet_generic_cdc_bind(struct usbnet *dev, struct usb_interface *intf)
 	/* override ethtool_ops */
 	dev->net->ethtool_ops = &cdc_ether_ethtool_ops;
 
+	if(dev->hard_mtu < 2048)
+		dev->hard_mtu = 2048;
+
 	return 0;
 
 bad_desc:
